      "id": "claim_39cba66d7eda4074b6b1c5b0e49056ef",
      "statement": "The decision-memory web client uses backend-relative `/api/v1/sessions` routes, always sends an `X-Anonymous-ID`, adds a bearer token when present, and the backend decision-memory handlers require either a verified user or an anonymous identifier before creating or listing sessions.",
