      "statement": "The backend↔AI runtime HTTP contract is currently aligned on `POST /api/v1/chat`, `POST /api/v1/chat/stream`, and `POST /api/v1/greeting`, but base URL alignment is configuration-sensitive because the backend uses `AI_RUNTIME_URL` while the AI runtime separately uses `backend_url` for callbacks into the backend.",
