      "id": "claim_7f1def4d41f041538dbacbd1db83526a",
      "statement": "The AI runtime stream emits named SSE events for `token`, decision-type events, `ui_operation`, `envelope`, and `done`; the backend parses and forwards those blocks and uses the final envelope or reconstructed content to persist the assistant message rather than treating the stream as opaque bytes.",
