      "statement": "The AI runtime reaches catalog data only through backend HTTP APIs: `ToolProxy` calls `GET /api/v1/products` and `GET /api/v1/products/:id/offer-comparison`, validates responses into Pydantic models, and surfaces backend HTTP failures instead of silently falling back.",
