      "statement": "Session-scoped comparison safety is enforced across the backend and AI runtime: the backend extracts previously recommended product ids into `allowed_comparison_ids`, and the AI runtime rejects comparison, offer-comparison, and checkout-ready actions for products not already available in the session.",
