      "statement": "Main-backend startup is fail-closed on Postgres, Redis, and Redis-backed jobs: bootstrap requires successful database, Redis cache, and Asynq job client connections, config loading rejects missing `DATABASE_URL`, `REDIS_URL`, or `JWT_SECRET`, and `/health` reports the service degraded if either database or Redis checks fail.",
