      "statement": "The Phong Vu integration tests define safety and normalization guarantees for the external retailer boundary: catalog parsing deduplicates products, normalizes VND pricing and source URLs, honors request timeouts, rejects non-Phong-Vu hosts, and can follow public catalog links to detail pages.",
