      "id": "claim_7c383918824f4938a2bf466bc3ad2610",
      "statement": "The repository currently has two different shared dynamic-UI contract surfaces: `@shopwise/protocols` models the newer AI envelope with `schema_version`, `conversation_state`, and `ui_operations`, while `@shopwise/ui-protocol` still models an older `DynamicUIDocument` with `schemaVersion: \"1.0\"`; the web decision-memory client validates the newer envelope directly, and the generic protocol renderer still rejects versions other than `1.0`.",
